# ZENAMANAGE CURSOR RULES — DEPRECATED

*Superseded 2026-07-23 by `PROJECT_CONSTITUTION.md` at repo root.*

Read `PROJECT_CONSTITUTION.md` instead — it is the single canonical source for mission, principles, hard constraints, and technical rules (architecture, naming, error handling, testing, multi-tenant isolation, security, CI/CD, definition of done).

This file is kept only so Cursor IDE tooling that auto-reads `.cursorrules` still finds a pointer instead of stale duplicated rules.
